## PR Title
Classes

## PR Description
This addes a new built in option to the widget factory classes which maps structural classes to theme classes. To make this possible it introduces three new documented widget methods _addClass, _removeClass, and _toggleClass.
- [x] Droppable - switch `activeClass` and `hoverClass` to use classes instead
- [x] Resizable  - Switch `ghost` option to use classes instead
- [x] Should resizable have an `icon` option? [ NO (IRC Log) ](http://irc.jquery.org/%23jqueryui-dev/default_%23jqueryui-dev_20150305.log.html#t07:16:55) https://github.com/arschmitz/jquery-ui/commit/f0d86013ee7582f5cfd852e8f45c11a3c784306b#commitcomment-9961378


