## PR Title
[SOURCE] Mailchimp: New Event Sources

## PR Description
A new PR for Mailchimp sources. There existed a previous [one](https://github.com/PipedreamHQ/pipedream/pull/1239) that unintendedly had modifications to Reddit files. This time only file related to Mailchimp are included.

Here are some notes:

New Segment Subscribers, don't have a since and before parameters to narrow down pagination, so currently they paginate across all items.
New List from the related Pipedream Issue for Mailchimp sources is the same as New Audience (there was a duplicated source in the issue)
New or Updated Subscriber was implemented as New Subscriber, and Email Address change or a Profile change (3 different events to Mailchimp)
New List Events is a superset to New or Updated Subscriber because it exposes all available events related to Audience Lists. However, I thought having New or Updated Subscriber as a different source could be relevant to Mailchimp users.

