## PR Title
Migrate kick, ban and unban command

## PR Description
I have added a kick, ban and unban command. I will be adding more moderation commands in the future.
For the kick command you have to do `/kick @user` were as for the ban command you have to do `/ban @user del_day(int)`. For the unban command you will type `/unban user_id`

Partially implements #63 and #64 .

